    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch12-14: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.43";
    dc:description "Finite program catalogs can test restricted, formalized versions and find counterexamples. They cannot establish a prevalence claim over all systems, and the categories require substantial interpretation.";
