    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Specify system classes, formal measures of repetitive, nested, and reducible behavior, then classify each system using predictor runtimes or proofs. Reducible non-simple cases or irreducible repetitive cases would refute the corresponding universal component.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "\"Obviously simple\" and \"practically all\" lack fixed thresholds.", "Available enumerations cover only selected program families.", "Observed complexity does not prove irreducibility.";
